  "description": "TIJLAC crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C210 H196 Gd8 N24 O44 4+,4(Cl1 O4 1-),2(C1 H4 O1),12(H2 O1). From the CIF bond table, Gd1 (Gd) has 6 O neighbors; Gd2 (Gd) has 8 O neighbors; Gd3 (Gd) has 8 O neighbors; Gd4 (Gd) has 8 O neighbors; Gd5 (Gd) has 8 O neighbors; Gd6 (Gd) has 8 O neighbors; Gd7 (Gd) has 8 O neighbors; Gd8 (Gd) has 6 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 13 pairs, 3 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.597-5.669 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 86.42-160.66°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C212H228Cl4Gd8N24O74. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 6 OH (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)), 2 H2O (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
